comment: Before the migration of MOP and RXNO to an ODK based workflow, this term was only defined in the RXNO release using the IRI MOP:0000715, which was already used in MOP for 'trimerization' (see also: https://github.com/rsc-ontology/rxno/issues/27). To resolve this IRI clash, '[3+2] cycloaddition' (MOP:0006371) was minted in MOP and all axioms wrongly asserted in RXNO on MOP:0000715 were copied over to it. {dcterms:creator="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1595-3213"}
