comment: Prior to the resolving of https://github.com/rsc-ontology/rxno/issues/27 the parent of this class was wrongly also defined in RXNO under the ID MOP:0000713 ('acetylene reduction'). \nThus the "has_participant some 'carboxy group'" axiom, which was not yet present on 'carboxylation' (MOP:0000591) in MOP was copied from this wrongly defined  'carboxylation' in RXNO to the proper one in MOP.\n\nThe only RXNO subclass 'Kolbe-Schmitt reaction' (RXNO:0000182) of 'carboxylation' was also moved to be correctly subsumed in RXNO. {created_by="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1595-3213"}
xref: https://www.rsc.org/Merck-Index/reaction/r239/
